It depends on the following Midnight components, each distributed under its own
license by the Midnight Foundation / Input Output:

  @midnight-ntwrk/compact-runtime
  @midnight-ntwrk/midnight-js-* (contracts, providers, indexer, http-client-proof-provider)
  @midnight-ntwrk/wallet-sdk-*
  @midnight-ntwrk/onchain-runtime-v3
  @midnight-ntwrk/ledger
  The Compact compiler (compactc) toolchain
  midnightntwrk/midnight-node, indexer-standalone and proof-server container images

